    case('EF-C11','EF-03','Cold3/Exhaustion1 enters dry20°C shelter for90 continuous minutes.','Cold falls3→2→1→0 at30/60/90 minutes. Exhaustion1 remains until its actual recovery. Exposure fraction clears after ten safe minutes.')
