    case('EF-C15','EF-03','A body is soaked in5°C air, then equips genuinely dry insulation while still in5°C air.','Wet severe-cold exposure stops only when the actual body/covered clothing is no longer soaked or the protection truly meets the dry complete-outfit rule. Swapping only a cloak over a still-soaked body is insufficient.')
