    case('EF-C17','EF-02','CON+2, full reserve, no air for192 uninterrupted seconds.','Reserve180 then grace12; atT192 suffocation assigns living positive HP to0 through actual lifecycle. No damage, tempHP absorption or Wound roll is created.')
    case('EF-C18','EF-02','CON−2 body receives a full reserve then loses air.','Reserve floors at30 seconds; grace floors at6. Suffocation starts after36 deprived seconds, not a negative or zero reserve.')
    case('EF-C19','EF-02','CON+2 body spends100 of180 reserve, breathes forfive seconds, then loses air again.','The five actual breathing seconds pause depletion and end any active suffocation prohibition, but do not refill.80 reserve and12 grace remain.')
    case('EF-C20','EF-02','Same body instead completes six uninterrupted seconds of actual breathing.','Refill reserve180 and grace12 from current CON; a future deprivation episode begins with those allowances.')
    case('EF-C21','EF-02','CON+2 body has used100 reserve seconds and changes to an explicitly nonbreathing body forone minute.','Pause at80 reserve and12 grace. Returning to a breathing body without air resumes those values; no free new breath from transformation.')
    case('EF-C22','EF-02','A full-reserve CON+2 creature has held its breath60 seconds and then performs a legally permitted exhaled breath attack.','Before that exhalation, spend remaining120 reserve. Grace12 remains; the attack still needs its actual cost, geometry and source permission.')
    case('EF-C23','EF-02','A water-breathing humanoid is submerged and tries an ordinary V spell without an underwater-speech permission.','This NEW proposed restriction rejects V casting; water breathing is not speech. No spell cost is paid for a declaration rejected before commitment. Actual underwater-speech exceptions retain their scope.')
    case('EF-C24','EF-02','A suffocating character has HP30 and tempHP20 when its grace expires.','Assign HP0; tempHP20 is retained but cannot stabilize or supply air. No numeric damage, Wound save or damage concentration check; zero-HP concentration loss follows actual rules.')
    case('EF-C25','EF-02','A suffocating dying character with one failure rolls natural20.','The proposed suffocation exception blocks1HP; clear successes, keepone failure and remain dying. No Decay-style Stable0 is inferred. This is an explicit consequential review question.')
    case('EF-C26','EF-02','A still-airless patient reaches three death-save successes and one failure.','Clear successes, keepone failure and remain dying under the proposed suffocation restriction. Do not add an extra death failure.')
    case('EF-C27','EF-02','A real Ritual Ward prevents suffocation-related actual death and its HP-blocked exception leaves Stable0.','Honor that exact replacement. If air is still unavailable six seconds later, deprivation enforcement endsStable; it adds no automatic death failure or damage. The actual normal death-save cadence resumes.')
    case('EF-C28','EF-02','A rescued unconscious patient is moved into air with a clear airway at0HP.','Suffocation prohibition ends immediately; no automatic HP or stabilization. A legal helper/feature can now stabilize/heal normally. Six actual breathing seconds restore reserve.')
    case('EF-C29','EF-02','A breathing Ranger Beast exhausts reserve and grace.','Use its actual immediate-death-at0 lifecycle and any truly eligible death replacement. Do not invent character death saves or a free companion resummon.')
    case('EF-C30','EF-02,EF-04','Field Tide Tea is active as a submerged creature exhausts its grace allowance.','No roll exists to gain+1 on; it adds neither breath seconds nor a rescue save. An actual current Athletics check can receive itsWater bonus.')
    case('EF-C31','EF-05','Enter a campfire atT0, leaveT1, reenterT3, remain throughT6.','One1d6 packetT0, noneT3, next1d6 atT6. No generic Burning record is added by this fire profile.')
    case('EF-C32','EF-05','Cross three connected engulfing-room squares within five seconds.','One3d6 contact packet from that fire complex, not one per square. Another packet requires six elapsed seconds since the prior one and actual contact.')
    case('EF-C33','EF-05','Alchemist’s fire is attached while the target also stands in a mundane campfire.','The reviewed attached Burning record and the separate new area contact source use their respective actual markers. Do not attach a duplicate generic tick to the area source. Existing ongoing-fire family competition remains intact.')
    case('EF-C34','EF-05','An adjacent helper spends an Action extinguishing attached Burning on a target still in a room fire.','Ordinary-extinguishable attached records end under the reviewed Action. The room volume still exists and its next actual contact packet remains due.')
    case('EF-C35','EF-05','Spend one actual gallon and one Action on the reachable campfire square.','Its mundane source is extinguished; deduct real water. No room-wide extinction, free water, deleted gear or magical-fire cure follows.')
    case('EF-C36','EF-05','Dense room smoke; fire is out and vent opened atT0, kept open120 seconds.','Dense/unbreathable through first60 seconds; thin/breathable atT60; clear atT120. Breath budget refills only after six continuous actual breathing seconds, not at vent opening.')
    case('EF-C37','EF-05','In that room, vent closes atT59 and reopensT61 while source remainsout.','First phase resets; thin startsT121 and clearT181 if uninterrupted. No accumulated59-second shortcut remains.')
