    case('EF-C41','EF-06','Walk30 without swim Speed moves through genuinely difficult debris-filled water.','Cost is strongestterrain2 plus nonspecialist1 =3 perfoot, so10 feet uses30. Do not multiply to4 perfoot.')
    case('EF-C42','EF-06','An ordinary current marker arrives; a swimming creature spends Reaction and succeeds Athletics12.','No drift for that marker. Its treading/depth support remains its own requirement. The next current marker remains the original+6 seconds.')
    case('EF-C43','EF-06','The same check is a Critical Failure and no independent support exists.','Drift10 feet through the channel, then sink5 at that marker. A wall stops drift without invented impact damage. Existing support would prevent the sink.')
    case('EF-C44','EF-06','An unconscious body with a printed swim Speed has no actual flotation or anchor.','It lacks active stationary-swim support; drift and proposed sinking apply. Swim Speed grants neither breathing nor an unconscious hovering permission.')
    case('EF-C45','EF-06','A rescuer’s physical and Load limits both permit a casualty; walk30, burden−10, no swim Speed.','Towing halves otherwise-current walk-swimmingSpeed20 to10. Nonspecialist water costs2 perfoot, permitting5 feet this turn before additional legal movement grants.')
