    case('EF-C55','EF-01,EF-03','An eight-hour rest completes exactly when a failedcoldcheckatcold3 gainsExhaustion.','Resolve the actual duehazard with existingendpoint precedence; activecoldcause prevents genericremovalofthatblocked-sourceExhaustion. Do not award an extra eight-hourrest orerase the newlevel from a scenechange.')
